{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1384663-winry-thorsdottir-rockbell","id":1384663,"title":"Winry \"Thorsdottir\" Rockbell","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-29T10:24:43-07:00","id":1384663,"title":"Winry \"Thorsdottir\" Rockbell","content":"One of the players in my Cabal is trying to build a Free Council Obrimos styled after Winry Rockbell from FMA with a mixed Thor/Hephaestus flavor. She's particularly interested in the various lightning powers from Forces as far as spells go, but she also wants to craft magical weapons and armor. To that end I suggested taking Matter as her third Arcanum. I expect she'll want to go Forces 3, Matter 2, Prime 1. She also is considering spending her Merits on either an Artifact, Enhanced Item, or Imbued Item, or some combination of the three. The spells that leap to mind as most relevant would be her oversize wrench as an Enhanced Item with Kinetic Blow or Find the Balance and perhaps some work gloves with Alchemist's Touch. These would be 2 dot Merits since they are all using 2 dot spells, right? Any other ideas for such items? I'm also curious how crazy she can get with crafting. She wants to make power armor and other such cyberpunk style gear. I'm not sure how realistic that is within this system. Also, she wants to take skill specialization in &quot;magic items/weapons&quot; which sounds a bit too vague in my opinion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26087-zenbear","name":"ZenBear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-29T10:47:06-07:00","id":1384667,"title":"","content":"She can definitely make power armor, though it will likely run the risk of getting hit with Dissonance. The specializations are probably fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-29T12:31:40-07:00","id":1384684,"title":"","content":"For power armor, the Clockwork Knights are pretty awesome:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1291687-new-legacy-the-clockwork-knights\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...ckwork-knights</a><br /> <br /> Don't miss the chance to make her mentor a famous Abyss hunter, with a super shotgun, in a crusade to Rip &amp; Tear all Abyss spawns.<br /> <br /> If she wants to focus on automail from the high tech enhanced item angle, this 2ed conversion of the Transhuman Engineers might be interesting:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://m45t1g05.blogspot.com/2016/10/mage-awakening-2nd-edition-legacy.html?m=1\" target=\"_blank\">https://m45t1g05.blogspot.com/2016/1...egacy.html?m=1</a><br /> <br /> Lastly, if she is tending more towards the item imbuement side, then I recommend the Thaumatech Engineers:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/981289-2e-legacy-thaumatech-engineers\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...tech-engineers</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}